281
00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:07.640
You can have something you love that's working now.

282
00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:11.780
And also it's good to remember that we have to hold these things with an open hand.

283
00:12:11.780 --> 00:12:15.160
It might not work forever, but we'll enjoy it now while it does.

284
00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:21.700
Or if you do have something that's working, but it's connected to something in your season of life

285
00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:25.500
that's frustrating to you and you wish it were different, that's okay.

286
00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:27.200
Now isn't forever.

287
00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.760
It probably won't always be this way.

288
00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:31.780
So try not to resent where you are.

289
00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.780
Either way, now isn't forever.

290
00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:40.200
So those are your three rules as you move into naming what's working.

291
00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:41.300
The smaller, the better.

292
00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:43.220
Working doesn't mean perfect.

